&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;strong&gt; About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;👐&lt;strong&gt; About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;The Consumer Tribe builds the Alma app for consumers. To tackle more topics and accelerate the development of the consumer experience, the current Consumer squad is splitting into two dedicated squads: Alma Wallet and Consumer Engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alma Wallet &lt;/strong&gt;builds the payment experience of the app. With the Alma card, consumers can pay with Alma anywhere, not only at our partner merchants. In the app, they can manage their payments using Apple Pay, Google Pay or local payment methods. By taking Alma beyond our merchant network, the Alma card is one of the company&#39;s key strategic bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Engagement &lt;/strong&gt;drives consumer activation, engagement and long-term retention by helping people get more value from Alma. The team builds experiences that make it easier for consumers to discover partner merchants, benefit from loyalty and cashback rewards, and manage their account independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;In 2027, the focus is on turning Alma into a more engaging, everyday consumer experience by strengthening loyalty, increasing repeat usage and making Consumer Engagement a key driver of Alma&#39;s long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;This is a new position created as the consumer app organization splits into two squads to tackle more topics. You will join one of these squads and work closely with its Engineering Manager, Product Manager, Designer and back-end engineers. You will report to &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/gautier-labarre-6b1530146/&quot;&gt;Gautier Labarre&lt;/a&gt;, Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI), open to full remote from Metropolitan France.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💼&lt;strong&gt; About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and ship meaningful consumer experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and release new features in the Alma app from design to production, working closely with Product, Design and back-end engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make payments simple and secure:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate payment SDKs and native mobile capabilities such as Apple Pay, Google Pay, card management, biometrics and secure storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the quality bar of the app:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep the application fast, reliable and maintainable through automated testing, monitoring, code reviews and continuous performance improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help the team learn and move forward:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to technical decisions, challenge product and back-end implementation when needed, and improve the team’s architecture, tooling and release processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧰&lt;strong&gt; You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Mobile: Expo / EAS, Expo Router, React Native, React 19, TypeScript, TanStack Query, Redux Toolkit, react-hook-form, Zod, Reanimated, Unistyles, MMKV, Nitro modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Tests: Jest, Testing Library, Maestro. Payments: Adyen, Stripe,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://checkout.com/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1174583716&quot;&gt;Checkout.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Observability: Datadog, Sentry, OpenTelemetry, OpenFeature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Back-end: Python, FastAPI. Tools: GitHub, Linear, Notion, Figma, Crowdin, Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧩&lt;strong&gt; About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of experience building mobile applications with &lt;strong&gt;React Native and TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience releasing apps on both the App Store and Google Play.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have a strong understanding of the React Native ecosystem, including Expo, navigation, state management and data fetching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You care deeply about software quality and have experience with testing, code reviews, monitoring and mobile performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English and comfortable working in a cross-functional, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have worked on payment products, fintech products or other security-sensitive applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have experience contributing to a consumer application used at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Are comfortable challenging product or back-end implementation when it does not provide the best user or technical outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have experience with web development in addition to mobile development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧘&lt;strong&gt; What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Work on products at the heart of Alma&#39;s strategy, including the Alma card, new payment methods in the app and our loyalty programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Solve real mobile fintech challenges involving payment SDKs, Apple Pay, Google Pay, biometrics and secure storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Use a modern mobile stack based on Expo 57, React Native’s New Architecture, React 19, TypeScript 7, Reanimated 4 and Nitro modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🤑&lt;strong&gt; Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎯&lt;strong&gt; Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to understand your path, motivation and present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to deep dive into the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live testing session with members of the Mobile Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt; to assess your practical knowledge and approach to mobile development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coffee Chat with members of the squad you would join&lt;/strong&gt;, with the panel adapted to Alma Wallet or Consumer Engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt; Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CreativeX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreativeX is B2B SaaS technology platform that helps global marketing teams make smarter creative decisions and elevate creative expression through the clarity of data. Our technology powers creative decision-making at some of the biggest brands in the world, including Google, Unilever, Pepsi, Bayer, Mondelez, Heineken, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use computer vision and other machine learning techniques to extract creative data from our client&#39;s digital advertising copy and transform those previously dark signals into a standardised data model at industrial scale. This creates a new, unique and powerful first party data set that represents the last and most impactful untapped reservoir of advertising performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s because multiple studies have shown that the &quot;Creative&quot; itself is responsible for half of sales lift online, higher than reach, targeting, brand, &amp;amp; recency combined. But creative impact has always been the least analysed and least understood component of a complex set of marketing variables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the problem CreativeX is focussed on solving. We&#39;re an end-to-end solution to ingest, process, and analyse content at scale. We help brands isolate creative elements so they can be analysed against downstream ad impact metrics, from clickthrough rates to brand lift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our objective is to help marketing organisations power every creative decision with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you&#39;ll help shape the next generation of the CreativeX platform, taking problems from discovery through to shipped experiences across defined areas of the product. You&#39;ll be the design lead in a product trio alongside a Product Manager and an Engineering Lead, owning whether users want what we build and whether they can figure out how to use it, while sharing discovery, outcomes and trade-offs with your partners. CreativeX is a complex product with rich data, multiple user types and increasingly sophisticated AI capabilities, and as AI increases the volume and speed of creative production, you&#39;ll make that complexity work for marketers, helping them measure performance fast, find the patterns behind what&#39;s working and see whether their full set of ads is delivering the strategy. Our roadmap is framed as problems to solve, not screens to make, so we expect you to bring a point of view. Product Design is a small, hands-on team in a scale-up: you&#39;ll be trusted with real ownership early, and this hire is an important step in growing the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for defined product areas, from understanding the problem through to working with Product and Engineering to ship the right experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get close to marketers and creative teams through customer conversations, research and usability testing, using what you learn to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering in discovery to validate real problems, challenge assumptions and make sensible trade-offs between customer value, business needs and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative data, insights and AI-powered capabilities into intuitive workflows, dashboards and decision-making tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for the platform, not just the feature, building on existing patterns and connecting experiences across CreativeX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and extend our design system, creating and documenting patterns and components so they&#39;re implemented consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar through strong interaction and visual design craft, and by giving and receiving feedback in critiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from what you ship, using customer feedback, product data and research to improve the experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first 90 days&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the CreativeX platform, our customers and our design system, and work as the design lead in your product trio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of a defined product area and ship, or get build-ready, your first piece of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our AI-powered product work and add to or improve patterns in our design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join customer conversations and use what you hear to shape your design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first year&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for one or more product areas, taking work from discovery through to launch with little direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship work you can point to, using customer feedback and product data to show whether it solved the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build out new parts of our design system and make the product feel more coherent across areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how design works at CreativeX as the team grows, including supporting newer designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of product design experience, with a portfolio that shows how you framed problems, explored options, made trade-offs and learned from what shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interaction and visual design craft, confident in Figma, prototyping and design systems, and familiar with Slack and Linear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using research, usability testing and customer feedback to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems mindset and the ability to make complex information, workflows and data easy to understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, collaborative communication: you challenge ideas constructively, take feedback well and know when to ship and learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Product and Engineering in a product trio or small team, with real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/em&gt; B2B SaaS, data-heavy or analytics products; marketing, advertising or martech; AI-powered products; mentoring junior designers; scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreativeX, we encourage applicants of all backgrounds and identities to apply for roles that align with their own interests and career trajectory. If you fit the description above and see yourself in this role, we would love to see your application! &lt;em&gt;Unfortunately, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 Private Medical Insurance and Health Cash Plan&lt;br&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;br&gt;📚 Education budget to be used for individual learning experiences or grouped with your team for joint learning&lt;br&gt;🧘 Annual subscription to Calm and Headspace for your mental wellbeing&lt;br&gt;🎟 Monthly coaching to talk to a trained professional about career goals, relationships, and personal development&lt;br&gt;💵 Competitive salary including stock options, as we believe that everyone should have a stake in the business&lt;br&gt;🍼 4-month full pay parenting leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CreativeX provides equal employment opportunities for all applicants and employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure workplace, CreativeX conducts standard right to work and background checks on all potential employees. This process is designed to verify the accuracy of information provided by candidates and to ensure a safe environment for all employees. Background checks are conducted via a secure third party application and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Plateforme Mobilité et Device Management recherche un·e Ingénieur·e Workspace ONE UEM / MDM basé·e à Lille&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous gérons l&#39;épine dorsale de la mobilité chez Decathlon avec plus de 150 000 terminaux gérés au quotidien sur notre plateforme Workspace ONE. Nos enjeux majeurs : garantir une expérience utilisateur fluide et performante sur le terrain (terminaux magasins et logistiques Android en priorité), industrialiser la gestion de notre parc et renforcer le niveau de sécurité global.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoins une feature team internationale et passionnée, où l&#39;agilité, l&#39;automatisation et le partage d&#39;expertise sont au cœur de nos pratiques quotidiennes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein d’une Feature Team composée de 4 ingénieurs et d&#39;un Product Manager, tu seras le garant du bon fonctionnement, de l&#39;optimisation et de l&#39;évolution technique de notre plateforme &lt;strong&gt;Workspace ONE UEM&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu&#39;&lt;strong&gt;Ingénieur·e MDM / UEM&lt;/strong&gt;, tu agiras concrètement sur l&#39;enrôlement, la configuration, la distribution applicative et le maintien en condition opérationnelle et de sécurité de notre flotte mondiale de &lt;strong&gt;150 000 devices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes principales missions seront de :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administrer et configurer la console Workspace ONE UEM&lt;/strong&gt; : gestion des Smart Groups, déploiement des profils de configuration, des catalogues applicatifs et des règles de conformité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter le cycle de vie des terminaux mobiles&lt;/strong&gt; : enrôlement de masse (Android Zero-Touch, Samsung Knox Mobile Enrollment, Apple Business Manager / ADE), mises à jour d&#39;OS et gestion des flottes partagées (magasins / logistique).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrialiser et automatiser&lt;/strong&gt; : concevoir des scripts d&#39;automatisation et exploiter les &lt;strong&gt;APIs REST de Workspace ONE&lt;/strong&gt; pour réduire les tâches manuelles et intégrer l&#39;UEM au reste de notre écosystème IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Garantir la sécurité et la conformité&lt;/strong&gt; : appliquer les politiques de sécurité (chiffrement, accès conditionnel, gestion des certificats) en étroite collaboration avec l&#39;équipe InfoSec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prendre en charge l&#39;expertise N3&lt;/strong&gt; : investiguer et résoudre les incidents complexes, analyser les logs et travailler en lien avec le support éditeur si nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participer aux projets de déploiement et de migration&lt;/strong&gt; : tester les nouvelles fonctionnalités, mener des phases de pilotes (PoC / UAT) et rédiger la documentation technique et les procédures pour les équipes support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plateforme UEM&lt;/strong&gt; : Workspace ONE UEM, Workspace ONE Access, Hub Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systèmes d&#39;exploitation&lt;/strong&gt; : &lt;strong&gt;Android Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt; (Dedicated/COBO, Fully Managed, Work Profile), &lt;strong&gt;iOS / iPadOS&lt;/strong&gt;, notions sur macOS / Windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programmes d&#39;enrôlement&lt;/strong&gt; : Android Zero-Touch, Samsung KME, Apple Business Manager (ABM / ADE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automatisation &amp;amp; Intégration&lt;/strong&gt; : APIs REST, scripting (Python, PowerShell, Bash, Postman).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils collaboratifs &amp;amp; Agilité&lt;/strong&gt; : Jira, Confluence, Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passionné·e par les technologies mobiles et l&#39;administration système, tu disposes d&#39;une solide expérience pratique dans la gestion et le dépannage d&#39;un parc de terminaux à grande échelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &lt;/strong&gt;dans l&#39;administration quotidienne et le paramétrage d&#39;une solution UEM, idéalement &lt;strong&gt;Workspace ONE&lt;/strong&gt; (une certification est un vrai atout).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maîtrise des spécificités Android Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt; (modes de gestion, gestion des flottes partagées et dédiées) et de l&#39;environnement &lt;strong&gt;Apple (iOS/iPadOS)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences pratiques en scripting et APIs&lt;/strong&gt; (Python, PowerShell) pour automatiser des flux opérationnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d&#39;analyse et de diagnostic (Niveau 3)&lt;/strong&gt; : rigueur dans le troubleshooting, analyse des logs terminaux et console.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens du service et esprit d&#39;équipe&lt;/strong&gt; : goût pour le travail en méthode agile, rigueur documentaire et esprit d&#39;amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais professionnel&lt;/strong&gt; indispensable (contexte d&#39;équipe international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital (Lille, Paris) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni adapté à tes missions et à nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows ou Chromebook) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe locale au sein d’un réseau mondial (opportunités de mobilité et de carrières internationales) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement continu des compétences (certifications éditeurs prises en charge dès la 1ère année, formations techniques, conférences) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package attractif (actionnariat salarié, primes mensuelles/trimestrielles, avantages sportifs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

